Source: iowatchd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Thiapalm <thiago.palmieri@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, make
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/Thiapalm/iowatchd
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: iowatchd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: logrotate
Description: lightweight disk IO monitor
 iowatchd samples /proc/diskstats with minimal resources and, when disk
 utilization exceeds a threshold, logs the processes doing the most IO to
 the system journal and a log file.
